en.helpBody = "Walk onto the pier. Hold F, then release to cast. You can also hold the small on-screen hint with your mouse. On mobile, use the orange button.\n\nAfter a bite, hold to reel. At resistance, release and tap 9 times in 4 seconds, then hold again.\n\nUse B or the top-bar bag to inspect your collection. Walk to the market, workshop or your tank, then press E or the interaction prompt to open the relevant actions.\n\nPlace an egg with your chosen feed. After 40–60 seconds it hatches into a separate animal pet. Equip one in the Pets tab for real fishing bonuses.\n\nStudio starts in temporary mode. Stop resets your data. Follow README for cloud saves and offline hatch testing."
